e
S http://fmwww.bc.edu/repec/bocode/u
N unique.pkg
D 12 Nov 2025
U 6
d 'UNIQUE': module to report number of unique values in variable(s)
d 
d  The command unique without a by reports the number of unique
d values for the varlist. With a by it does the same, but also
d creates a new variable (_Unique by default but can be named in
d the gen option). This new variable contains the number of unique
d values of the varlist for each level of the by variable. The new
d variable is coded missing except for the first record in each
d group defined by the levels of the by variable. The command is
d useful for exploring data where the records refer to more than
d one level, for example longitudinal data where each record refers
d to a visit by a subject.
d 
d 
d Requires: Stata version 10.1
d 
d Distribution-Date: 20200618
d 
d Author: Tony Brady
d Support: email tony@@sealedenvelope.com
d 
f u\unique.ado
f u\unique.sthlp
e
S http://fmwww.bc.edu/repec/bocode/o
N outreg.pkg
D 13 Nov 2025
U 7
d 'OUTREG': module to write estimation tables to a Word or TeX file
d 
d outreg arranges the results of Stata estimation commands in
d tables as they are typically presented in journal articles,
d rather than as they are presented in the Stata Results window. By
d default, t statistics appear in parentheses below the
d coefficient estimates with asterisks for significance levels.
d outreg provides as complete control of the statistics,  layout,
d and formatting of estimation tables as possible, both  in Word
d and TeX files.  Almost every aspect of the table's  structure and
d format (including fonts and Greek letters) can  be specified with
d options.  Multiple tables can be written to  the same document,
d with paragraphs of text in between,  creating a whole statistical
d appendix.  outreg works after any estimation command in Stata.
d Successive estimation results, with different variables, can be
d merged into a single table.  In addition to writing a  Microsoft
d Word or a TeX file, the reformatted table is displayed in the
d Results window.  This is a complete rewrite of earlier versions
d of outreg.
d 
d KW: estimates
d KW: table
d KW: formatting
d KW: Microsoft Word
d KW: LaTeX
d 
d Requires: Stata version 10.1
d 
d 
d Author: John Luke Gallup, Portland State University
d Support: email jlgallup@@pdx.edu
d 
d Distribution-Date: 20150918
d 
f o\outreg.ado
f o\outreg.sthlp
f f\frmttable.ado
f f\frmttable.sthlp
f f\frmt_opts.sthlp
f o\outreg_complete.sthlp
f o\outreg_update.sthlp
f g\greek_in_word.sthlp
f l\l_cfrmt.mlib
e
